{"ID":"20240118151236-jzy8tf3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151236-jzy8tf3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151236-jzy8tf3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151236-kpjtzcs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130111229-yrty00n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130111229-yrty00n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"116熊脂","type":"doc","updated":"20240130111233"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151236-kpjtzcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151236-kpjtzcs","updated":"20240122111837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘微寒，主风痹不仁，筋急，五藏腹中积聚，寒热羸瘦，头疡白秃，面皯，久服强志，不饥轻身。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111839-iqzgzek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111839-iqzgzek"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】熊身上之脂肪。今已经不用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122111840-h5rvc5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111840-h5rvc5q"}},{"ID":"20240122111841-2kou4i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111841-2kou4i5"}},{"ID":"20240122111841-hc65qf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122111841-hc65qf7","updated":"20240130111233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第116味药，熊脂，现在是拿不到了，野生动物保护法，有的时候是查获了一百多只熊掌，真是很恶劣，我到现在基本没开过。熊的脂肪，熊脂，你看它的功能，风痹，不仁，筋急，五脏腹中积聚，头疡，你说有没有效，肯定有效，我们可以用别的方法来取代，我看到杀一只熊来救的，我不赞成这种做法，即使熊没有保护，到处都是熊，我不赞成讲这个，这个很残忍。那如果说它只是有效，一定很有效，因为熊的力量很大，而且熊可以走，可以站，很多动物只能走不能站，然后这个熊的性是彪悍，因为它的脂肪很强，如果它是一般的猪就算了，猪膏啊，熊脂，开出来药房也没有，药房吓死了，以为写错。对啊。晓得就不要去问，没用啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240130111229-yrty00n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130111229-yrty00n"}}]}